  "solution": "1. ÷, ×, =, +, −\n\n__**720 ÷ 24**__ × 4 = __**100 + 40**__ - 20\n\n⇒ __**30 ×**____** 4**__ = __**140 - 20**__\n\n⇒ 120 = 120\n\n2. −, +, ÷, ×, =\n\n720 - 24 + __**4 ÷ 100**__ × 40 = 20\n\n⇒ 720 - 24 + 0.04 × 40 = 20\n\n⇒ 720 - 24 + __**0.04 ×**____** 40**__ = 20\n\n⇒ __**720**__ - 24 + **__1.6__** = 20\n\n⇒ __**721.6 - 24**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 697.6 ≠ 20\n\n3. +, =, ×, ÷, −\n\n__**720 + 24**__ = 4 × __**100 ÷ 40**__ - 20 \n\n⇒ 744 = __**4 **____**× 2.5**__ - 20 \n\n⇒ 744 = __**10 - 20 **__\n\n⇒ 744 ≠ -10 \n\n4. ×, ÷, +, =, − \n\n720 × __**24 ÷ 4**__ + 100 = 40 - 20\n\n⇒__** 720 **____**× 6**__ + 100 = 20\n\n⇒ __**4320**____** + 100**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 4420 ≠ 20\n\nHence, '**÷, ×, =, +, −**' is the correct answer.",
